// Title: Potential DLL Sideloading Of MsCorSvc.DLL
// ID: cdb15e19-c2d0-432a-928e-e49c8c60dcf2
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Wietze Beukema
// Date: 2024-07-11
// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.persistence, attack.execution, attack.stealth, attack.t1574.001
// Description: Detects potential DLL sideloading of "mscorsvc.dll".
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

any where ((ImageLoaded endswith "\\mscorsvc.dll") and not (((ImageLoaded startswith "C:\\Windows\\Microsoft.NET\\Framework\\" or ImageLoaded startswith "C:\\Windows\\Microsoft.NET\\Framework64\\" or ImageLoaded startswith "C:\\Windows\\Microsoft.NET\\FrameworkArm\\" or ImageLoaded startswith "C:\\Windows\\Microsoft.NET\\FrameworkArm64\\" or ImageLoaded startswith "C:\\Windows\\WinSxS\\"))))
